Details
-------

The .NET Framework Reference Source (https://github.com/microsoft/referencesource, MIT License, Copyright (c)
Microsoft Corporation) is the origin of WebFormsForCore's port of System.Web, System.Configuration,
System.Web.Extensions, System.Web.Services, System.Web.Mobile, System.Web.DataVisualization, System.Web.DynamicData,
System.Web.Entity and aspnet_compiler, taken through WebFormsForCore's fork of it
(https://github.com/simonegli8/WebFormsCoreReferenceSource). The files keep Microsoft's headers.

This product includes software from the ASP.NET Web Stack (https://github.com/aspnet/AspNetWebStack, commit
2106565), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt). That software carries the
following notice:

