(https://github.com/xforcore/drawingForCore): System.Drawing.Common 6.0 from .NET (MIT License, Copyright (c) .NET
Foundation and Contributors) with a GDI+ engine on SkiaSharp (MIT License). Its NOTICE lists its components, including
SkiaSharp and Skia. Up to webForCore 0.6.0 they were built in this repository.

