Material inherited from WebFormsForCore
---------------------------------------

The fork base contained .NET Framework binaries and code decompiled from .NET Framework assemblies and other Microsoft
products, which no open licence covers. webForCore replaced all of it with Microsoft's MIT-licensed originals, other
MIT-licensed sources, or its own code written from the documented APIs, or removed it. docs/LICENSING.md lists each
item and what replaced it.
